# Working notes stay private. These carry the reasoning, the defects found,
# the checksums and the open items, and are not written for a reader.
*_Findings.md
*_findings.md
*Findings*.md
*_Conformance*.md
*_Retrieval*.md
*_Update*.md
*Notes.md

# Preserved sources and pass baselines. Never published, never overwritten.
RECEIVED_*
RECEIVED__*
PRESPEC_*
PRE_UPDATE__*
SOURCE_*
SOURCE__*
INBOUND_*
*.frozen
*.keep
sources/
SOURCE_ARCHIVE/
_source_snapshots/

# The .received-<date>. infix convention, caught by name rather than by
# location, so a snapshot dropped outside _source_snapshots/ is still excluded.
*.received-*
*.received-*.md

# Scripts a pass writes for itself, and their output.
check_*.py
diff_*.py
probe_*.py
apply_*.py
*.log
CHECKSUMS.txt

# The governing document and its templates are the working reference,
# not part of the published set. Remove these two lines if you want them public.
HOUSE_STYLE.md
TEMPLATE_*.html

# Local tooling config, not project content.
.claude/

# OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
